    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/84db12ba58acae80f16bdf489ec17959.poster.avif?t=1747767631\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/84db12ba58acae80f16bdf489ec17959.webm?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/84db12ba58acae80f16bdf489ec17959.mp4?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to\u00a0<strong>The Egg Game</strong>, the relaxing (and slightly silly) adventure where you're not just any ordinary character, you're an egg! A smooth, round, wobbly little egg that jumps out of its cozy cup and rolls across a 3D kitchen filled with animated chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/5c3d7fdc5e0fc600be0561188e6edf97.poster.avif?t=1747767631\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/5c3d7fdc5e0fc600be0561188e6edf97.webm?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/5c3d7fdc5e0fc600be0561188e6edf97.mp4?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR GOAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll through dynamic kitchen environments without cracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge dangerous obstacles, including sharp knives, microwaves, meat grinders, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect golden yolks to boost your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch rare and quirky birds to build your egg-themed collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/9d5563e0c3b85709ac44d8c6f17f2dbf.poster.avif?t=1747767631\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/9d5563e0c3b85709ac44d8c6f17f2dbf.webm?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/9d5563e0c3b85709ac44d8c6f17f2dbf.mp4?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls:</strong>\u00a0Easy-to-learn controls make the game enjoyable for players of all ages and skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich 3D Kitchen World:</strong>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a charming, cozy kitchen environment brought to life with interactive objects and detailed animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Collectibles:</strong>\u00a0Hatch and discover 12 unique bird characters, each with their own distinctive personality: Meet Silly, Puddles, Eggward, Plumb, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Unwind with soothing music and calming gameplay designed for casual and stress-free enjoyment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Scores &amp; Achievements:</strong>\u00a0Compete for top spots on the leaderboards and unlock fun achievements as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for casual fun, a relaxing escape, or simply to experience life as a rolling egg,\u00a0<strong>The Egg Game\u00a0</strong>offers a uniquely enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to roll? Play\u00a0<strong>The Egg Game</strong>\u00a0now and test how far your egg can go without cracking!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/84db12ba58acae80f16bdf489ec17959.poster.avif?t=1747767631\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/84db12ba58acae80f16bdf489ec17959.webm?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/84db12ba58acae80f16bdf489ec17959.mp4?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to\u00a0<strong>The Egg Game</strong>, the relaxing (and slightly silly) adventure where you're not just any ordinary character, you're an egg! A smooth, round, wobbly little egg that jumps out of its cozy cup and rolls across a 3D kitchen filled with animated chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/5c3d7fdc5e0fc600be0561188e6edf97.poster.avif?t=1747767631\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/5c3d7fdc5e0fc600be0561188e6edf97.webm?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/5c3d7fdc5e0fc600be0561188e6edf97.mp4?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR GOAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll through dynamic kitchen environments without cracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge dangerous obstacles, including sharp knives, microwaves, meat grinders, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect golden yolks to boost your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch rare and quirky birds to build your egg-themed collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/9d5563e0c3b85709ac44d8c6f17f2dbf.poster.avif?t=1747767631\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/9d5563e0c3b85709ac44d8c6f17f2dbf.webm?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562620/extras/9d5563e0c3b85709ac44d8c6f17f2dbf.mp4?t=1747767631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls:</strong>\u00a0Easy-to-learn controls make the game enjoyable for players of all ages and skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich 3D Kitchen World:</strong>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a charming, cozy kitchen environment brought to life with interactive objects and detailed animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Collectibles:</strong>\u00a0Hatch and discover 12 unique bird characters, each with their own distinctive personality: Meet Silly, Puddles, Eggward, Plumb, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Unwind with soothing music and calming gameplay designed for casual and stress-free enjoyment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Scores &amp; Achievements:</strong>\u00a0Compete for top spots on the leaderboards and unlock fun achievements as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for casual fun, a relaxing escape, or simply to experience life as a rolling egg,\u00a0<strong>The Egg Game\u00a0</strong>offers a uniquely enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to roll? Play\u00a0<strong>The Egg Game</strong>\u00a0now and test how far your egg can go without cracking!</p>",
